  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-01-21T07:29:36.991Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please add support for Magica Cloth 2.\n\nI understand that the implementation of PhysBones was great—it runs well and offers many features. However, relying on Unity's built-in Cloth component is extremely poor in terms of performance. The game would greatly benefit if Unity's Cloth component were either blacklisted or limited to a single component.\n\nMagica Cloth 2 would provide a much better physics system compared to Unity's Cloth component. Theoretically, if appropriately limited, it could even enable Cloth physics on Quest platforms, such as the Quest 2, Quest 3/3S, or Quest Pro.\n\nDo please consider as this would greatly benefit content creation on this platform.\n\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/tools/physics/magica-cloth-2-242307\n\nhttps://magicasoft.jp/en/magica-cloth-2-2/",
